        "dashboard-7970ac3e2a8cf3f45b4a"
      ],
      "text": "savePlace posts the JSON request body to placesUrl/places with an application/json content type, waits up to ten seconds, and forwards the response status and JSON body. A fetch or JSON-decoding error returns 503 PLACES_UNAVAILABLE. The saved process links this request to the proposed Places.Save mapping and separate request-publisher and event-consumer views. The target service binding and network result are unverified; linked event views do not establish downstream processing, delivery or execution order."
    },
    "title": "Dashboard save-city thread"
  },
